    "background_story": "Paloma was a rare and majestic albino dove, born with a genetic condition that made her feathers a radiant white. She lived in a lush forest, where her striking appearance made her a local legend. Despite being an outcast among her fellow doves, Paloma's gentle nature and soothing coos earned her the respect and admiration of the other birds. Her albinism also granted her a unique gift \u2013 the ability to navigate through the dense forest with ease, using the faint moonlight to guide her. At night, Paloma would take to the skies, her ghostly form silhouetted against the moon, as she sang a haunting melody that echoed through the forest, a lullaby to all who lived within its shadows.",
